WRP), the bootloader is made immutable for enhanced security. Like SBSFU and OEMiRoT, OEMiSB enables secure boot only and can be integrated and customized by users. </p> <ul> <b>Features: </b> <li>Checks static protections (options bytes), activates runtime protection, and verifies the integrity of the user application code before every execution (no authenticity)</li> <li>No secure firmware update </li> </ul> <h3>Supporter series</h3> <div class="card-grid"> <a target="_blank" href="https://www.st.com/en/microcontrollers-microprocessors/stm32c0-series.html" class="card"><svg viewBox="0 0 595.28 424.478" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <g fill="#03234b"> <path d="M192.822 178.105c9.109-5.266 19.117-10.658 28.08-15.84 4.682-2.706 9.712-5.137 13.68-8.16 1.994-1.518 2.565-3.551.803-5.64a264280.15 264280.15 0 0 0-63.944 37.109c.35.128.683.2 1.221.45 8.662.981 13.424-4.025 20.16-7.919z"> </path> <path d="M455 197.029c-.25-2.25-1.5-9.5-1.5-9.5s-.5-1.25-1.25-1.5a2.16 2.16 0 0 1-.146-.075v-7.115c-.74.424-22.884 13.104-26.202 15.2-3.375 2.133-11.724 6.484-16.52 2.133-4.796-4.352 1.243-7.195 1.243-7.195l23.28-13.422c-5.718-3.283-12.468-7.164-19.802-11.382v-7.334c-.74.424-22.884 13.104-26.202 15.2-3.375 2.133-11.724 6.484-16.52 2.133-4.796-4.352 1.243-7.195 1.243-7.195l23.152-13.349c-6.824-3.928-13.808-7.948-20.674-11.902v-6.887c-.74.424-22.884 13.104-26.202 15.2-3.375 2.133-11.724 6.484-16.52 2.133-4.796-4.352 1.243-7.195 1.243-7.195l23.55-13.578c-7.316-4.214-14.154-8.153-20.071-11.563v-6.997c-.74.424-22.884 13.104-26.202 15.2-3.375 2.133-11.724 6.484-16.52 2.133-4.796-4.352 1.243-7.195 1.243-7.195l23.458-13.525-3.334-1.922s-3-3.75-9.25-.25c-2.482 1.391-29.666 17.144-61.532 35.628 2.076.813 3.982 1.208 6.654.879 2.307-.284 4.632-2.241 6.48-1.921 2.243.39 5.805 2.898 8.64 4.561 39.043 22.896 86.569 49.713 124.86 72.237l-2.934 1.653c-4.105 2.447-.063 5.287-.063 5.287l6.854 3.916-8.811 5.385v4.406l-2.824 1.314-.113 4.07-5.875-2.693.246-3.916 2.937-1.957.199-3.977s-2.797-3.28