25 1.5 10.251 3.25 11.751 138.5 80.75 138.5 80.75L447 220.779s2.25-1.5 3-4.5 5.25-17 5-19.25zm-133.075 79.604l-.055-2.715 2.661 1.357-2.606 1.358zm74-43l-.055-2.715 2.661 1.358-2.606 1.357z"> </path> </g> </svg> <h4>STM32U0</h4> </a> </div> </div> <div id="tab-7" class="inner-tab-content fade-in"> <p>On flashless and microprocessor devices, a secure boot solution is implemented inside the ROM and is immutable. It ensures the verification of the first stage bootloader. It is dedicated per product. Please refer to the product series for more information.</p> <h3>Supported series</h3> <div class="card-grid"> <a target="_blank" href="https://www.st.com/en/microcontrollers-microprocessors/stm32n6-series.html" class="card"><svg viewBox="0 0 595.28 424.478" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <g fill="#03234b"> <path d="M192.822 178.105c9.109-5.266 19.117-10.658 28.08-15.84 4.682-2.706 9.712-5.137 13.68-8.16 1.994-1.518 2.565-3.551.803-5.64a264280.15 264280.15 0 0 0-63.944 37.109c.35.128.683.2 1.221.45 8.662.981 13.424-4.025 20.16-7.919z"> </path> <path d="M455 197.029c-.25-2.25-1.5-9.5-1.5-9.5s-.5-1.25-1.25-1.5a2.16 2.16 0 0 1-.146-.075v-7.115c-.74.424-22.884 13.104-26.202 15.2-3.375 2.133-11.724 6.484-16.52 2.133-4.796-4.352 1.243-7.195 1.243-7.195l23.28-13.422c-5.718-3.283-12.468-7.164-19.802-11.382v-7.334c-.74.424-22.884 13.104-26.202 15.2-3.375 2.133-11.724 6.484-16.52 2.133-4.796-4.352 1.243-7.195 1.243-7.195l23.152-13.349c-6.824-3.928-13.808-7.948-20.674-11.902v-6.887c-.74.424-22.884 13.104-26.202 15.2-3.375 2.133-11.724 6.484-16.52 2.133-4.796-4.352 1.243-7.195 1.243-7.195l23.55-13.578c-7.316-4.214-14.154-8.153-20.071-11.563v-6.997c-.74.424-22.884 13.104-26.202 15.2-3.375 2.133-11.724 6.484-16.52 2.133-4.796-4.352 1.243-7.195 1.243-7.195l23.458-13.525-3.334-1.922s-3-3.75-9.25-.25c-2.482 1.391-29.666 17.144-61.532 35.628 2.076.813 3.982 1.208 6.654.879 2.307-.284 4.632-2.241 6.48-1.921 2.243.39 5.805 2.898 8.64 4.561 39.043 22.896 86.569 49.713 124.86 72.237l-2.934 