row-thin"></use> </svg> Back</div> <div class="internal-section"> <h2>Secure platform attestation</h2> <p>Initial attestation is the process of verifying that a device meets defined security requirements before engaging in secure operations.</p> <p> At ST’s factory, devices are provisioned with unique digital identities—cryptographic key pairs and certificates signed by ST’s Certificate Authority (CA). The certificate and public key are securely stored on the device, while the private key remains protected within its secure environment.</p> <p> This factory-programmed identity allows the device to prove its authenticity and integrity when communicating with external systems. Embedded with ST’s CA public key, the device can verify certificates issued by ST, establishing a trusted chain of security. </p> <h3>Supported series</h3> <div class="card-grid"> <a target="_blank" href="https://www.st.com/en/microcontrollers-microprocessors/stm32u3-series.html" class="card"><svg viewBox="0 0 595.28 424.478" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <g fill="#03234b"> <path d="M192.822 178.105c9.109-5.266 19.117-10.658 28.08-15.84 4.682-2.706 9.712-5.137 13.68-8.16 1.994-1.518 2.565-3.551.803-5.64a264280.15 264280.15 0 0 0-63.944 37.109c.35.128.683.2 1.221.45 8.662.981 13.424-4.025 20.16-7.919z"> </path> <path d="M455 197.029c-.25-2.25-1.5-9.5-1.5-9.5s-.5-1.25-1.25-1.5a2.16 2.16 0 0 1-.146-.075v-7.115c-.74.424-22.884 13.104-26.202 15.2-3.375 2.133-11.724 6.484-16.52 2.133-4.796-4.352 1.243-7.195 1.243-7.195l23.28-13.422c-5.718-3.283-12.468-7.164-19.802-11.382v-7.334c-.74.424-22.884 13.104-26.202 15.2-3.375 2.133-11.724 6.484-16.52 2.133-4.796-4.352 1.243-7.195 1.243-7.195l23.152-13.349c-6.824-3.928-13.808-7.948-20.674-11.902v-6.887c-.74.424-22.884 13.104-26.202 15.2-3.375 2.133-11.724 6.484-16.52 2.133-4.796-4.352 1.243-7.195 1.243-7.195l23.55-13.578c-7.316-4.214-14.154-8.153-20.071-11.563v-6.997c-.74.424-22.884 13.104-26.202 15.2-3.375 2.133-11.724 6.484-16.52 2.133-4.796-4.352 1.24